Purpose
-------
Replay both exact nonces from the automatic dual-site source pair and capture
the first two entry-RIP RDTSC callbacks. Schema v11 preserves the callback-time
pre-charge clock ledger, then adds the completed quantum's instruction count
and cumulative retired count through the RDTSC instruction.

